# Pyrokinesis divides its damage among three creatures: Ms. Marvel, Bot1's Ornithopter, and Bot2's Ornithopter. The trigger is
# about the spell being cast (CR 603.2), so it triggers once however many creatures of Bot1's it targets, and an opponent's
# creature among the targets does not matter: the stack is Pyrokinesis and one trigger, Bot1 draws one card (two in hand,
# so Ms. Marvel's base power is 2), and the one grant is all there is. Pyrokinesis is cast by exiling Lightning Bolt from the hand.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Ornithopter
Ms. Marvel, Kamala Khan
Pyrokinesis
Lightning Bolt
Island
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Ms. Marvel, Kamala Khan.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Pyrokinesis.Cast(Ability: Exile)
Bot1.Divide(Ms. Marvel, Kamala Khan: 1; Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter: 1; Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter: 2)
Bot1.Choose(Lightning Bolt)
? Stack.Count = 2
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ms. Marvel, Kamala Khan.Power = 2
? Stack.Count = 1
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand.Count = 2
Bot1.Library.Count = 19
Bot2.Graveyard = Ornithopter
Exile = Lightning Bolt
Bot1.Battlefield.Ms. Marvel, Kamala Khan.Damage = 1
